category: Libs
requires: libdotconfpp0 pkg-config
sdesc: "Dotconf like configuration file parser written in C++ (development)"
ldesc: "dotconf++ is a dotconf like configuration file parser written in C++. It
supports macro substitution from the environment or from the file itself,
config file inclusion, easy handling of XML like tags, checking for required
tags, and more."
external-source: dotconfpp

